    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "\ud83d\udcd6 Novice Analyst Guide: Geolocation Hazards & OSINT Intelligence",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \ud83c\udf0d Geolocation Risk & Threat Intelligence Enrichment\n* **Geographic Threat Heatmap:** Maps destination IP addresses by country, city, latitude, and longitude. Red markers indicate high-risk locations.\n* **ASN Reputation & Country Density:** Highlights high-risk Autonomous System Numbers (bulletproof hosting providers, known bulletproof ASNs).\n* **Threat Intel Feeds:** Correlates connections with AlienVault OTX, AbuseIPDB (confidence $\\ge 75\\%$), and VirusTotal."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "geomap",
      "title": "\ud83c\udf0d World Geolocation Threat & Traffic Heatmap",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dfm29b4en3im8e"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "home_ids_geo_risk > 0",
          "format": "table",
